  "description": "THE MISSING SPACE. app/cbl/COMEN01C.cbl:159-163 STRINGs 'This option ' DELIMITED BY SIZE, then CDEMO-MENU-OPT-NAME(WS-OPTION) DELIMITED BY SPACE, then 'is coming soon ...' DELIMITED BY SIZE. The middle operand stops at the first space of the 35-byte name, so only 'Account' survives, and the suffix has no leading space - the composed text is therefore 'This option Accountis coming soon ...' with the two words run together. That is what the program does and it is not this migration's to repair. The statements are reachable only when line 146 finds the 'DUMMY' five-byte prefix and skips the XCTL, which no copybook entry can produce, so the table is a stub differing from the copybook's first entry in nothing but the program name. Line 158 also overrides the mapset's COLOR=RED with DFHGREEN here, and nowhere else in the program.",
